<title>USA: FOB Gulf Grain - Corn basis remains on defensive.</title>
<headline>FOB Gulf Grain - Corn basis remains on defensive.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>FOB corn basis values were steady to lower on Thursday as increasing availability of new crop supplies kept nearby values on the defensive.</p>
<p>Dealers noted harvesting of corn was picking up with mostly dry weather expected in key growing regions over the next few days.</p>
<p>Wheat basis values were steady in very slow trade, with demand still sluggish as the U.S. continued to struggle to compete in the export market against rival suppliers such as Argentina.</p>
<p>Soybean basis values were steady to slightly higher.  </p>
